"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6589","characterName":"かりん","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6589"},"originalCharacterName":"かりん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"While Akira is strong and forthright, Karin is shy, insecure, and easily flustered. These qualities are epitomized most by her smaller stature and younger age compared to her co-workers. Karin is prone to fits of clumsiness while carrying serving trays, and thus is frequently relegated to cashier or greeter duty. She is easily influenced and often becomes an unwilling participant in practical jokes, most often Makoto's. Akira is her best friend and personal hero, both figuratively and literally."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6589"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/ccf302e7a815673e00e68ce30227fdd49a1eb4fc7a805eecbea180a4df144fc7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/02/02a55a6c1147b67e1207d0add07b28a95fdfca6b46ecd52b83f5ecfcdf463fae.webp","width":160,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6590","characterName":"サキ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6590"},"originalCharacterName":"サキ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Saki is the eldest and most sensible of the Anne Mitter's waitresses. Tall and graceful, Saki is nonetheless hampered by a weak will and enduring pessimism."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6590"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{}